  "worked_solution": "A mathematical statement is a sentence or mathematical expression that is either true or false. \n\nOf the given sentences, the only sentence that is either true or false is \"$3$ is a positive number.\" (This sentence is true.)\n\nAll the other sentences are neither true nor false.",
